## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to fuse graph shortest-path ideas with node activation delays and cycle handling, plus choosing between DAG DP and general graph Dijkstra.

## Key Concepts
- Dijkstra with transformed edge costs w(u,v)+d(v)
- Topological sort for DAG optimization
- Handling multiple sources S
- Non-negative weights guarantee correctness

## Code Example
```javascript
function earliestFinish(V, adj, S, d) {
  const INF = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY;
  const dist = new Array(V).fill(INF);
  const pq = new MinHeap((a,b)=>a[0]-b[0]);
  for (const s of S) { dist[s] = d[s]; pq.push([dist[s], s]); }
  while (!pq.isEmpty()) {
    const [du, u] = pq.pop();
    if (du !== dist[u]) continue;
    for (const [v, w] of adj[u]) {
      const cand = dist[u] + w + d[v];
      if (cand < dist[v]) { dist[v] = cand; pq.push([cand, v]); }
    }
  }
  return dist;
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
